          "short": "$x(3x-12+y)$",
          "worked": "The HCF is $x$.\n$$\\begin{align*}3x^2-12x+xy&=x(3x-12+y)\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 20
      },
      {
        "id": "p14-q8-h",
        "type": "part",
