          "worked": "The HCF is $3x$.\n$$\\begin{align*}3x^2-12x+6xy&=3x(x-4+2y)\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 20
      },
      {
        "id": "p14-q8-i",
